---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Hotel Espir" description="About Lost Souls Interactive, the studio behind Hotel Espir.">
  <main class="container">
    <section class="section">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Lost Souls Interactive (LSI)</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        LSI is composed of 9 developers from all over the world. We've
        banded together as artists to create an experience like no other.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Mission</h2>
      <p>
        Our mission is to contribute to the new wave of digital artists that
        blend art, history, and technical skills into our favorite medium for
        telling stories and entertaining.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Values</h2>
      <p>
        We value the era of gaming where you could sit down, play a game, not
        be bothered, and not ever have to ask the question if the money spent
        was worth it. We never used to wait for sales to get our favorite
        games, we waited outside stores on opening night.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What makes us unique</h2>
      <p>
        As a studio, our distance from one another makes us far different
        from most. Throughout the development of Hotel Espir alone, many of
        us have experienced loss. To start with, our first programmer went
        away to climb in the Italian alps, and we never heard from him again.
        While we don't know exactly what happened to him, it never felt like
        he left us, but never came back. Since then, losing people we know
        and love has plagued our studio, making the distance between us feel
        all the more lonely.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:contact@lostsoulsinteractive.com">contact@lostsoulsinteractive.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .tagline {
    color: var(--color-muted-foreground);
    margin: 0;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-style: dashed;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
</style>
